<title>USA: Claire's Stores same-store sales up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Claire's Stores same-store sales up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PEMBROKE PINES, Fla. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Claire's Stores Inc Thursday reported sales for the four weeks and three months ended November 2.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$29.8	$23.8	 +25	   +7</p>
<p>3rd Quarter     $102.5	$79.8	 +28	  +10</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
